GIVEN `the statement is the statement of compliance required` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 24(4) the registrar may rely on the statement of compliance as sufficient evidence of the matters stated` MEANS
    CONSIDER `the statement is the statement of compliance required`
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN JUST TRUE
    WHEN JUST FALSE THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the power is given for "the statement of compliance"
    WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): follows s 24(3)

-- ---- s 25: Effect of alteration of articles on company's members -----------------------------------------

-- src:294 | (2) Subsection (1) does not apply in a case where the member agrees in writing, either before or after the alteration is made, to be bound by the alteration.
