`s 26(1) the copy of the articles as amended was sent in time` MEANS
    IF `the date the copy of the articles as amended is sent to the registrar` AT MOST (`the date the amendment takes effect` PLUS 15)
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "it must send to the registrar a copy of the articles as amended not later than 15 days after the amendment takes effect" (a period the text fixes in its own words, ruling of 2026-11-05 (a))

DECLARE `s 26(1) action` IS ONE OF
