    WITHIN 15 -- days, counted from the day the amendment takes effect
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST BREACH BY Company BECAUSE "a copy of the articles as amended was not sent to the registrar within 15 days after the amendment took effect"

-- src:297 | (2) This section does not require a company to set out in its articles any provisions of model articles that—
