`s 26(4) the most the daily default fine can be for each day of continued contravention, in pounds` MEANS
    `level 3 on the standard scale, in pounds` TIMES 0.1

-- ---- s 27: Registrar's notice to comply in case of failure with respect to amended articles --------------

-- src:304 | 27 Registrar's notice to comply in case of failure with respect to amended articles
