    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "The notice must— (a) state the date on which it is issued, and (b) require the company to comply within 28 days from that date" (a bare "must" not done, fork F-C1; "within 28 days" read as 28 days exactly, fork F-s27)

