    THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "If the company complies with the notice within the specified time, no criminal proceedings may be brought in respect of the failure to comply with the enactment mentioned in subsection (1)"
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the bar applies only "If the company complies with the notice within the specified time"

