-- ---- s 29 ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- src:322 | 29 Resolutions and agreements affecting a company's constitution
-- src:323 | (1) This Chapter applies to—
-- src:324 | (a) any special resolution;
-- src:325 | (b) any resolution or agreement agreed to by all the members of a company that, if not so agreed to, would not have been effective for its purpose unless passed as a special resolution;
-- src:326 | (c) any resolution or agreement agreed to by all the members of a class of shareholders that, if not so agreed to, would not have been effective for its purpose unless passed by some particular majority or otherwise in some particular manner;
-- src:327 | (d) any resolution or agreement that effectively binds all members of a class of shareholders though not agreed to by all those members;
-- src:328 | (e) any other resolution or agreement to which this Chapter applies by virtue of any enactment.
@ref s 29(1) Resolutions and agreements affecting a company's constitution: what Chapter 3 applies to (src:322-328)
GIVEN `s 283 the resolution is a special resolution` IS A MAYBE BOOLEAN
      `the resolution or agreement is agreed to by all the members of the company and would not, if not so agreed to, have been effective for its purpose unless passed as a special resolution` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the resolution or agreement is agreed to by all the members of a class of shareholders and would not, if not so agreed to, have been effective for its purpose unless passed by some particular majority or otherwise in some particular manner` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the resolution or agreement effectively binds all members of a class of shareholders though not agreed to by all those members` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the resolution or agreement is one to which Chapter 3 applies by virtue of any enactment` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 29(1) this Chapter applies to the resolution or agreement` MEANS
    IF       `the resolution or agreement is agreed to by all the members of the company and would not, if not so agreed to, have been effective for its purpose unless passed as a special resolution`
         OR  `the resolution or agreement is agreed to by all the members of a class of shareholders and would not, if not so agreed to, have been effective for its purpose unless passed by some particular majority or otherwise in some particular manner`
         OR  `the resolution or agreement effectively binds all members of a class of shareholders though not agreed to by all those members`
         OR  `the resolution or agreement is one to which Chapter 3 applies by virtue of any enactment`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE CONSIDER `s 283 the resolution is a special resolution`
         WHEN JUST TRUE THEN JUST TRUE
         WHEN JUST FALSE THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (list not closed): the list in s 29(1) is not closed with "only"
         WHEN NOTHING THEN NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (points outside the text): whether a resolution is a special resolution is s 283's answer

