    THEN JUST FALSE -- FALSE-kind (the text says no in its own words): "References in subsection (1) to a member of a company, or of a class of members of a company, do not include the company itself where it is such a member by virtue only of its holding shares as treasury shares"
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the flat negative names only the company itself holding shares as treasury shares

