-- ---- s 37 and s 38: Supplementary provisions -------------------------------------------------------------

-- src:421 | 37 Right to participate in profits otherwise than as member void
-- src:422 | In the case of a company limited by guarantee and not having a share capital any provision in the company's articles, or in any resolution of the company, purporting to give a person a right to participate in the divisible profits of the company otherwise than as a member is void.
@ref s 37 Right to participate in profits otherwise than as member void (src:421-422)
GIVEN c IS A `Company profile`
      `the provision is in the company's articles or in a resolution of the company` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the provision purports to give a person a right to participate in the divisible profits of the company otherwise than as a member` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 37 the provision is void` MEANS
    CONSIDER `s 3(3) the company is limited by guarantee` (c's `liability of the members`)
    WHEN JUST TRUE THEN
        IF (NOT c's `a share capital`) AND `the provision is in the company's articles or in a resolution of the company` AND `the provision purports to give a person a right to participate in the divisible profits of the company otherwise than as a member`
        THEN JUST TRUE
        ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "In the case of a company limited by guarantee and not having a share capital any provision in the company's articles, or in any resolution of the company, purporting to give a person a right to participate in the divisible profits of the company otherwise than as a member is void"
    OTHERWISE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): the sentence is for "a company limited by guarantee and not having a share capital"

-- src:423 | 38 Application to single member companies of enactments and rules of law
-- src:424 | Any enactment or rule of law applicable to companies formed by two or more persons or having two or more members applies with any necessary modification in relation to a company formed by one person or having only one person as a member.
@ref s 38 Application to single member companies of enactments and rules of law (src:423-424)
GIVEN `the enactment or rule of law is applicable to companies formed by two or more persons or having two or more members` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the company was formed by one person or has only one person as a member` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A MAYBE BOOLEAN
`s 38 the enactment or rule of law applies to the company with any necessary modification` MEANS
    IF `the enactment or rule of law is applicable to companies formed by two or more persons or having two or more members` AND `the company was formed by one person or has only one person as a member`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "Any enactment or rule of law applicable to companies formed by two or more persons or having two or more members applies with any necessary modification in relation to a company formed by one person or having only one person as a member"
